                0.177,
                0.639,
                0.626,
                0.653
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 解方程 \\( x2 - 3x + 2 = 0 \\)，得 \\( (x - 1)(x - 2) = 0 \\)，∴ \\( A = \\{1, 2\\} \\)。"
